# Real C M5 management adapter. D dependencies must be supplied; default production rejects.
# Fill IDs/tokens only in private local variables. No test identity headers exist in production.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@accessToken = {{privateAccessToken}}
@targetUserId = {{privateTargetUserId}}
@targetDeptId = {{privateTargetDeptId}}

### US01: items and total must both be filtered by current real C appointment scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20&status=1&source=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### US02: hidden/out-of-scope target returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### US04: signature/audit failure must roll back status and session version
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":2,"reason":"Task12 management integration demonstration"}

### DP01: session and real C scope are rechecked in the Service transaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments?includeDescendants=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### DP02: subtree is intersected with current scope before counting/paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{targetDeptId}}/users?includeDescendants=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### DP03: C management locks precede organization locks; requires an unfrozen eligible actor
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{targetDeptId}}/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Task12 controlled freeze demonstration"}
